# PUBLIC repository: credentials and personal data must never end up here.

# Rainmeter Calendar, files in @Resources/Google:
#   client_secret*.json   Google OAuth client (copied by hand between PCs)
#   token.dat             refresh token encrypted with DPAPI (valid only on the PC that created it)
#   data.tsv, request.txt events/tasks downloaded and the widget's last request
#   last-error.txt        last error of gcal.ps1
#   resize.txt/.out       request/result of the resize helper
**/Google/client_secret*.json
**/Google/token.dat
**/Google/data.tsv
**/Google/data.tsv.tmp
**/Google/request.txt
**/Google/last-error.txt
**/Google/resize.txt
**/Google/resize.out

# Sticky Notes: your notes (@Resources/Notes) and the widget's run-time files
# (@Resources/Data: titles shown by each window, colours, deleted notes) stay
# on your PC. Only the empty folders are kept, the skin needs them on first start.
rainmeter/Notes/@Resources/Notes/*
!rainmeter/Notes/@Resources/Notes/.gitkeep
rainmeter/Notes/@Resources/Data/*
!rainmeter/Notes/@Resources/Data/.gitkeep
